abstract: >
  Design specification for HossRide, an original Android title by
  Hossein Tabasi. The setting is Tehran at permanent night and
  permanent rain. The destination is Amirabad. The landmark is
  Milad Tower, placed by locked geometry. The governing thesis is
  that filtration, not velocity, decides every downstream call.
  The rider is immobilised. Infinite distance is produced by moving
  the world. Relative velocity is the only motion quantity. This
  repository is specification-complete. It does not contain a
  shipped binary.
